{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"157aa1b070e17c8456ae617e6926d2c3e7c8c8f229400035bc8127a8791b4e42","ja":"ついにこの日が来たね、やよいちゃん！\n『キラメキ　春の大運動会』、頑張ろうね！","zh":"终于等到这一天了，小弥生！\n『闪耀 春季大运动会』，一起加油吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a7d823401725acdf139d3898f0140357afee1ae70299db752c216a79fdbb0656","ja":"はいっ！　私、今日のためにいっぱい走ったんですよ！\nMVPになりたいなーって！","zh":"好！我今天为了这个跑了好多呢！\n想要成为MVP啊——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f35532b0b8e6fb8e6a31c8db3f169ea0afcd01c9c763ad3c3a36e0e8da0d88f7","ja":"すっごい気合入ってるんだね！\nMVPになったら、TVにいっぱい映れるから……とか？","zh":"你真是干劲十足啊！是因为如果当上MVP，就能经常上电视……之类的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d8f2ca06362c72a3d131bdeede23996117c928f5d68cd4202bfac66053502cc0","ja":"それもあるんですけど、MVPになったら\nギフト券がもらえるって聞いて……。","zh":"这也是原因之一，不过我听说成为MVP\n就能拿到礼品券……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"739c3313df7e195f778822142dc81abbc87187211a2603093d8be99ba96f9598","ja":"私、『セカキュー』のグッズが欲しいんです！","zh":"我想要『セカキュー』的周边！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a8c2bf25501686f9460ddd1778fece3f915237db85b77495bb91127d9427f943","ja":"そうなんだ！　じゃあ、団体戦でやよいちゃんに\n貢献できるように、私も頑張らないと！","zh":"原来是这样啊！那么，为了能在团体战中为小弥生\n做出贡献，我也得努力才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"72277dbdfc6a4fba5ab42ffd148ce1dbaddff05b9466f17b730b1fb91eed2259","ja":"えへへ、ありがとうございますっ！\n一緒に頑張りましょう！","zh":"嘿嘿，谢谢您！一起加油吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"872e2345ed3448b87c2cd31c0bad326e020b2b38a3511182a79463290446eb27","ja":"うっうー！　私、ワクワクしてきました～！\nちょっと早いけど、もう着替えちゃいますね♪","zh":"呜——！我开始兴奋起来了～！\n虽然有点早，不过我要换衣服了哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7e5dd52655f7f47105fbac5560e79131cd86b844785362047bda8664597e5215","ja":"そうだね！　準備運動とか、走行コースの予習とか、\n本番前にできること、全部やっちゃおう♪","zh":"说得对！　准备运动、熟悉赛道之类的，\n正式比赛前能做的事，全都做一遍吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1011.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6d11136acccef0a70fb7228ed906fd15782d5f8d64903a6cb557286840445771","ja":"はい！　よろしくお願いしまーす！","zh":"好！请多指教——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
